7. PAID LICENSES (YUME PRO)
   The software is fully functional at its free capacity. A paid license
   ("Pro") raises the tab, pane and window limits. Two are offered, at the
   prices shown at the point of purchase:

   Monthly. A license to use the software at Pro capacity for as long as the
   subscription is paid. It may be cancelled at any time and runs to the end of
   the period already paid for.

   Lifetime. A one-time payment for a perpetual license to use the software at
   Pro capacity, with no recurring fee. It covers every version of the software
   that is published, including versions published after your purchase. Nothing
   in this agreement obliges the copyright holder to publish any further
   version, and Section 5 applies to every version alike.

   Both are non-exclusive and non-transferable. A license is granted to one
   person, identified by the email address the key was issued to, and that
   person may install the software on any number of machines they use
   themselves. Licenses may not be shared, resold, or assigned. Keys for other
   people must be issued by the copyright holder; passing your own key to
   someone else is a breach of Section 1.

   When a Pro license ends, by cancellation or expiry, the software reverts to
   its free capacity. It does not stop working and no copies need be destroyed.
   Termination under Section 6 is separate and does require destruction.

8. VALIDATION
   A Pro license key is checked against a licensing server when you activate it
   and periodically afterwards. If the software cannot reach that server it
   keeps Pro capacity for seven days, then reverts to free capacity until it can
   check again. A permanent internet connection is not required, but a
   permanently offline machine cannot hold a Pro license.

9. REFUNDS FOR PAID LICENSES
   A Lifetime purchase may be refunded in full within 14 days of purchase, for
   any reason. Write to hi@yuru.be from the address you purchased with. The
   license key is revoked when the refund is issued.

   A Monthly subscription may be cancelled at any time and stops billing at the
   end of the current period. Periods already paid for are not refunded in part.

   A license terminated under Section 6 is not refunded.
